9)Write python program that swap two number with temp variable and without temp variable. 
Answer1:-with temp variable

a = int(input("Enter the Value of A : " ))
b = int(input("Enter the Value of B : " ))

temp = 0

print(f" The Value Before Swapping is : A = {a} and B = {b}")
temp = b
b = a 
a = temp

print(f" The Value After Swapping is : A = {a} and B = {b}")

Output:-Enter the Value of A : 10
	Enter the Value of B : 20
	The Value Before Swapping is : A = 10 and B = 20
	The Value After Swapping : A = 20 and B = 10

